Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/HaikuArchives/TakeNotes

Package: takenotes
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: post-it style notes
 TakeNotes keeps desktop notes as ordinary files with typed attributes.
 Tags are indexed on the boot volume, so notes stay searchable by tag,
 and a note can be linked to the application it belongs to.
